#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This module is designed to help users who have difficulty hearing audible "
"cues, or who have difficulty using a keyboard."
msgstr ""
"ម៉ូឌុល​នេះ​ត្រូវ​បាន​រចនា​ឡើង​ដើម្បី​ជួយ​អ្នក​ប្រើ​ដែល​មាន​ការ​លំបាក​ក្នុង​ការ​ស្ដាប់​អក្សរ​ដែល​អាច​ស្ដាប់​ឮ ឬ​មាន​ការ​"
"លំបាក​ក្នុង​ការ​ប្រើ​ក្ដារ​ចុច ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:37
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The module is divided into two tabs: <link linkend=\"access-bell"
#| "\"><guilabel>Bell</guilabel></link> and <link linkend=\"access-kb"
#| "\"><guilabel>Keyboard</guilabel></link>."
msgid ""
"The module is divided into ten tabs: <link linkend=\"access-zoom"
"\"><guilabel>Zoom &amp; Magnifier</guilabel></link>,<link linkend=\"access-"
"bell\"><guilabel>System Bell</guilabel></link>, <link linkend=\"access-"
"modifier-keys\"><guilabel>Modifier keys</guilabel></link>, <link linkend="
"\"access-keyboard-filters\"><guilabel>Keyboard Filters</guilabel></link>, "
"<link linkend=\"mouse-navigation\"><guilabel>Mouse Navigation</guilabel></"
"link>, <link linkend=\"access-activation-shortcuts\"><guilabel>Activation "
"Shortcuts</guilabel></link>, <link linkend=\"access-screenreader"
"\"><guilabel>Screen Reader</guilabel></link>, <link linkend=\"access-color-"
"blindness\"><guilabel>Color Blindness Correction</guilabel></link>, <link "
"linkend=\"access-invert\"><guilabel>Invert</guilabel></link>, and <link "
"linkend=\"access-shake-pointer\"><guilabel>Shake Pointer</guilabel></link>."
msgstr ""
"ម៉ូឌុល​ត្រូវ​បាន​ចែក​ជា​ពីរ​ផ្ទាំង ៖ <link linkend=\"access-bell\"><guilabel>កណ្ដឹង</"
"guilabel></link> និង <link linkend=\"access-kb\"><guilabel>ក្ដារ​ចុច</guilabel></"
"link> ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "Zoom &amp; Magnifier"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Zoom and Magnifier tools in KDE Plasma are designed to enlarge portions "
"of the screen, serving as a digital magnifying glass. While they share the "
"goal of making small text and fine details more legible, they offer two "
"distinct ways of interacting with the desktop environment."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "Zoom"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This panel is divided into an <guilabel>Audible Bell</guilabel> section "
#| "and a <guilabel>Visible Bell</guilabel> section."
msgid ""
"Here you can switch between the <guilabel>Full screen</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Magnify region</guilabel> modes."
msgstr ""
"បន្ទះ​នេះ​ត្រូវបាន​ចែក​ជា ផ្នែក <guilabel>កណ្ដឹង​ឮ</guilabel> និង​ផ្នែក <guilabel>មើល​ឃើញ​"
"កណ្ដឹង</guilabel> ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Full screen"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable fullscreen mode."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show pixel grid at zoom level"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Provide a visual overlay of the individual pixels that make up the image on "
"your screen once you have reached a high enough magnification. If enabled, "
"&plasma; draws a thin grid around every single pixel so you can see exactly "
"where one ends and the next begins."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pointer appearance"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Controls the mouse pointer appearance when zooming. There are several "
"options: <guilabel>Scale</guilabel>, <guilabel>Keep</guilabel>, and "
"<guilabel>Hide</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pointer tracking"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "Proportional"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Zoom area moves in sync with pointer."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "Centered"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pointer stays centered on-screen, except near screen edges."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Centered (Strict)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pointer stays centered on-screen, even near screen edges."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "Push"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pointer pushes zoom area at screen edges."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:134 index.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "Zoom area does not follow pointer."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sharpen screen content while zoomed in"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If turned on, &kwin; will use pattern recognition to try to scale the shape "
"of text/icons on the workspace at extreme zoom levels. This would help "
"improve overall text contrast at the cost of font accuracy by avoiding blur "
"or pixelation."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable focus tracking"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ensures the magnified viewport automatically follows the <quote>active</"
"quote> part of the interface, even if your mouse is not moving. While "
"standard zoom usually follows the mouse cursor, focus tracking monitors the "
"system focus (the text cursor or the currently selected UI element)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable text caret tracking"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Allows the system's magnification tools to follow the text cursor rather "
"than just the mouse pointer. In technical environments—whether you are "
"writing code, drafting a research manuscript, or filling out complex forms—"
"your focus is often where you are typing, which may be far away from where "
"your mouse is resting."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid "Magnify region"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable the region magnification mode."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "Width"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allows to configure the width of the magnified area."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid "Height"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allows to configure the height of the magnified area."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid "Disable the scaling modes."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid "Zoom factor"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adjusts how much the screen enlarges with each step (&eg;, 1.2x or 2.0x). "
"&plasma; supports extreme magnification levels (up to 100x), which is "
"significantly higher than most other operating systems."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scroll gesture modifier keys"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Allows you to perform scrolling actions using a combination of a keyboard "
"key and mouse movement, rather than using a physical scroll wheel."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is particularly useful for users who use trackballs, specialized "
"pointing devices without wheels, or who have motor impairments that make "
"using a scroll wheel difficult."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid "Zoom scroll gestures are only available on Wayland."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scroll while modifier keys are pressed to zoom"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this option enabled, holding down a specific key (usually the &Meta; "
"key) and rotating your mouse wheel (or using a two-finger scroll on a "
"touchpad) will dynamically increase or decrease the magnification of the "
"entire desktop."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure Shortcuts…"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use shortcuts to control zoom."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid "System Bell"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This panel is divided into an <guilabel>Audible Bell</guilabel> section and "
"a <guilabel>Visible Bell</guilabel> section."
msgstr ""
"បន្ទះ​នេះ​ត្រូវបាន​ចែក​ជា ផ្នែក <guilabel>កណ្ដឹង​ឮ</guilabel> និង​ផ្នែក <guilabel>មើល​ឃើញ​"
"កណ្ដឹង</guilabel> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:265
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The top check box labeled <guilabel>Use System Bell</guilabel>, determines "
"whether the normal System bell rings. If this option is disabled, the System "
"bell will be silenced."
msgstr ""
"ប្រអប់​ធីក​ខាងលើ​គេ​ដែល​មាន​ស្លាក <guilabel>ប្រើ​កណ្ដឹង​ប្រព័ន្ធ</guilabel> គឺ​សម្រាប់​កំណត់​ថា​តើ​កណ្ដឹង​"
"ប្រព័ន្ធ​ធម្មតា​រោទិ៍​ឬ​អត់ ។ បើ​មិន​ជ្រើស​ជម្រើស​នេះ កណ្ដឹង​ប្រព័ន្ធ​​នឹង​មិន​រោទិ៍​ទេ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:271
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The next check box down can be used to play a different sound whenever "
#| "the system bell is triggered. To activate, place a mark in the check box "
#| "labeled <guilabel>Use customized bell</guilabel>, and enter the complete "
#| "pathname to the sound file in the text box labeled <guilabel>Sound to "
#| "Play</guilabel>. If you want, you can select the <guibutton>Browse</"
#| "guibutton> button to navigate through your filesystem to find the exact "
#| "file."
msgid ""
"The next check box down can be used to play a different sound whenever the "
"system bell is triggered. To activate, place a mark in the check box labeled "
"<guilabel>Use customized bell</guilabel>, and enter the complete pathname to "
"the sound file in the text box labeled <guilabel>Sound to play</guilabel>. "
"If you want, you can select the <guibutton>Browse</guibutton> button to "
"navigate through your filesystem to find the exact file."
msgstr ""
"ប្រអប់​ធីក​បន្ទាប់​ខាងក្រោម​អាច​ត្រូវ​បាន​ប្រើ​ដើម្បី​ចាក់​​សំឡេង​នៅពេល​​ដែល​បាន​ប៉ះ​កណ្ដឹង​ប្រព័ន្ធ ។ ដើម្បី​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យវា​"
"សកម្ម គឺ​ត្រូវ​ធីក​ប្រអប់​ធីក​ដែល​មាន​ស្លាក <guilabel>ប្រើ​កណ្ដឹង​​ផ្ទាល់​ខ្លួន</guilabel> ហើយ​​បញ្ចូល​ឈ្មោះ​"
"ផ្លូវ​ពេញលេញ​ទៅកាន់​ឯកសារ​សំឡេង​ក្នុង​ប្រអប់​អត្ថបទ​ដែល​មាន​ស្លាក <guilabel>សំឡេង​ត្រូវ​ចាក់</"
"guilabel> ។ ប្រសិនបើ​អ្នក​ត្រូវការ អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស​ប៊ូតុង <guibutton>រកមើល</guibutton> ដើម្បី​"
"រុករក​តាម​រយៈ​ប្រព័ន្ធ​ឯកសារ​របស់​អ្នក​ដើម្បី​រក​ឯកសារ​ពិត​ប្រាកដ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:281
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "For those users who have difficulty hearing the System bell, or those "
#| "users who have a silent computer, &kde; offers the <emphasis>visible "
#| "bell</emphasis>. This provides a visual signal (inverting the screen or "
#| "flashing a color across it) when the system bell would normally sound."
msgid ""
"For those users who have difficulty hearing the System bell, or those users "
"who have a silent computer, &kde; offers the <emphasis>visual bell</"
"emphasis>. This provides a visual signal (inverting the screen or flashing a "
"color across it) when the system bell would normally sound."
msgstr ""
"សម្រាប់​អ្នក​ប្រើ​​ដែល​មាន​ការ​លំបាក​ក្នុង​ការ​ស្ដាប់​កណ្ដឹង​ប្រព័ន្ធ ឬ​អ្នក​ប្រើ​​ដែល​មាន​កុំព្យូទ័រ​ស្ងាត់ នោះ KDE "
"ផ្ដល់​នូវ <emphasis>កណ្ដឹង​មើល​ឃើញ</emphasis> ។ វា​​ផ្ដល់នូវ​សញ្ញា​ដែល​មើល​ឃើញ (បញ្ច្រាស​អេក្រង់ ឬ​"
"បញ្ចេញ​ពន្លឺ​ពណ៌​កាត់​វា) ពេល​កណ្ដឹង​ប្រព័ន្ធ​បន្លឺ​សំឡេង​​ធម្មតា ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:288
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To use the visible bell, first place a mark in the check box labeled "
#| "<guilabel>Use visible bell</guilabel>."
msgid ""
"To use the visual bell, first place a mark in the check box labeled "
"<guilabel>Use visual bell</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​ប្រើ​កណ្ដឹង​​មើល​ឃើញ ដំបូង​គឺ​ត្រូវ​ធីក​ប្រអប់​ធីក​ដែលមាន​ស្លាក <guilabel>ប្រើ​កណ្ដឹង​មើល​ឃើញ</"
"guilabel> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can then select between <guilabel>Invert screen</guilabel>, or "
"<guilabel>Flash screen</guilabel>. If you select <guilabel>Invert screen</"
"guilabel>, all colors on the screen will be reversed. If you choose "
"<guilabel>Flash screen</guilabel>, you can choose the color by clicking the "
"button to the right of the <guilabel>Flash screen</guilabel> selection."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស​រវាង <guilabel>ត្រឡប់​អេក្រង់</guilabel> ឬ <guilabel>អេក្រង់​បង្ហាញ​មួយ​ភ្លេត</"
"guilabel> ។ ប្រសិន​បើអ្នក​ជ្រើស <guilabel>ត្រឡប់​អេក្រង់</guilabel> ពណ៌​ទាំងអស់​នៅលើ​អេក្រង់​នឹង​"
"ត្រូវ​បាន​ត្រឡប់ ។ ប្រសិន​បើ​អ្នក​ជ្រើស <guilabel>អេក្រង់​បង្ហាញ​មួយ​ភ្លេត</guilabel> អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស​ពណ៌​"
